        "Children and young people who find everyday tasks harder than peers, such as dressing, eating, or following routines.",
        "Children and young people who experience sensory differences that affect comfort and participation in daily activities.",
        "Children and young people with coordination, handwriting or fine motor difficulties that impact learning or daily living.",
        "Children and young people with neurodevelopmental differences (including autism) needing functional support to participate fully in home, school and community life."
